          "id": "7d761335-8f8b-4f1f-8151-575d8d441215",
          "name": "Request Intraday Ohlc Bars for a Single Security.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Request Intraday Ohlc Bars for a Single Security.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Sends an `IntradayBarRequest` to the `//blp/refdata` service for time-bucketed\nOHLC bar data on a single security. Bar interval is configurable from 1 to 1440\nminutes. Supports event types of TRADE, BID, ASK, BID_BEST, ASK_BEST, BEST_BID,\nand BEST_ASK, gap fill of the initial bar, EID return, and corporate action\nadjustments.\n",
