          "id": "92c3d60a-d8c0-4aec-9afb-c79f85552144",
          "name": "Request Raw Intraday Tick Data for a Single Security.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Request Raw Intraday Tick Data for a Single Security.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Sends an `IntradayTickRequest` to the `//blp/refdata` service for raw tick-by-tick\ndata on a single security between two timestamps. Supports multiple event types\n(TRADE, BID, ASK, BID_BEST, ASK_BEST, BEST_BID, BEST_ASK, AT_TRADE) and optional\ninclusion of condition codes, exchange codes, broker codes, RPS codes, and\nnon-plottable events.\n",
